## Observations
- Even though the query "affordable laptop" doesn't exactly match any document 
  word-for-word, the top results are all laptop-related and budget-focused — 
  proving the model captured *meaning*, not just keywords.
- Unrelated items (gaming PC, smartphone) scored much lower, as expected.

